# Copy to .env and fill in your real key. NOTE: this Flue CLI version does not
# auto-load .env — pass `--env .env` to `flue connect`/`run`/`dev` (or export
# the vars first). For local runs of the GitHub automations you also need a
# GH_TOKEN (a PAT with repo scope) and GITHUB_REPOSITORY=owner/name.
OPENAI_API_KEY="your-openai-api-key"
